   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannibal_%28Static-X_album%29",
   "resumo_en": "Cannibal is the fifth studio album by American industrial metal band Static-X, released on April 3, 2007. This is the first album from the band to contain guitar solos; every song with the exception of \"Goat\" has one. Cannibal was the first album to be produced by John Travis, and the first album to not feature Ulrich Wild, who produced and/or mixed the band's first four albums, as well as the first not to feature a song with \"Otsego\" in the title. Lasting 37 minutes, it is the band's shortest album.",
